# SNAPSHOT — tnls (SSH tunnel manager)

Last updated: 2026-10-09 (commit 11)
Status: system tray + shutdown done, starting tests + CI
Current phase: Phase 1 — MVP (features complete, verification next)
Toolchain: Node v24.14.0, npm 11.9.0, rustc 1.96.0 (gnu default, msvc available), OpenSSH_for_Windows_9.5p1

## Product

Desktop app (Tauri 2 + React + Rust) quản lý SSH tunnels: lưu profiles,
bật/tắt bằng UI, chạy nền qua system tray, không cần terminal mỗi tunnel.

## Architecture (chốt)

Tauri 2 / React+TS+Vite / Rust+Tokio / OpenSSH process / SQLite /
tracing / GitHub Actions. Xem chi tiết: docs/DESIGN.md.

